{
  "key": "letter-032-part-01",
  "number": 32,
  "generationId": "01a1e4eb-fa7e-78d3-a73a-6b5d4c5a009b",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.569342
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I received your letter; I have been waiting for it ever since I returned But how sweet it is to wait!",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.685918,
      "end": 7.387687
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Life itself is a waiting!",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/03.mp3",
      "start": 8.535465,
      "end": 10.084921
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Seeds wait to sprout, rivers to reach the ocean.",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.241791000000001,
      "end": 14.29356
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "What does man wait for?",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.532109,
      "end": 16.76746
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He too is the seed for some tree, a river for some ocean.",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.969932,
      "end": 21.368526
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Whoever looks deep inside finds that a longing for the endless and boundless is his very being.",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/07.mp3",
      "start": 22.908163,
      "end": 28.804671000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "And whoever recognizes this begins his journey towards God because who can be thirsty and not look for water?",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/08.mp3",
      "start": 30.34542,
      "end": 37.570454
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "This has never happened and never will!",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/09.mp3",
      "start": 39.164286000000004,
      "end": 41.570249
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Where there is longing, there is thirst for attainment.",
      "path": "audio/1965-32/10.mp3",
      "start": 43.138503,
      "end": 47.96
    }
  ]
}
